<Page title="About ZentaPDF: Free PDF & Image Tools" description="ZentaPDF is a free collection of online PDF and image tools: edit, merge, convert and compress PDFs, resize photos, make QR codes and more. Learn who we are." h1="About ZentaPDF" path="/about/">
  <p>ZentaPDF is a free collection of online tools for working with PDF files and images, merging, splitting, converting and compressing.</p>
  <p>We built ZentaPDF because everyday document tasks, making a PDF smaller for an email, signing a form, resizing a photo for an online application, should be quick and free, without installing software or creating an account.</p>
  <h2>What we believe</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Respect for your files</strong>, we never sell or share the files you use with our tools.</li>
    <li><strong>Free for everyone</strong>, no sign-up, no watermarks, no daily limits. The site is supported by a small number of ads.</li>
    <li><strong>Simple and fast</strong>, one clear page per task that works on any computer or phone.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>ZentaPDF is part of the Zenta family of free online tools, alongside <a href="https://zentacalculator.com/">Zenta Calculator</a>.</p>
  <p>Questions or ideas? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
</Page>
